{"reference_id": "", "content": "Q: What specific technologies do you utilize to protect against DDoS attacks, and how are they integrated into your overall security architecture?\nA: Kestrel Cloud employs a combination of network traffic analysis and automated mitigation tools to counter DDoS attacks. Our compliance program, Kestrel Secure, mandates regular assessments of these controls. Customers are expected to manage their own firewall settings while we handle the backend protections. This delineation of responsibilities is crucial for maintaining a robust security posture across our IaaS and managed-container offerings."}
