{"reference_id": "", "content": "Q: In what ways do you provide customers with insights derived from telemetry data, and how is this information communicated to them?\nA: Kestrel Cloud offers insights derived from telemetry data through our compliance program, Kestrel Insight. We provide customers with quarterly summaries of system performance and usage metrics, ensuring they have the necessary information for compliance and resource management. Customers are responsible for monitoring their specific container configurations, while we maintain oversight of the underlying infrastructure. This structured approach ensures clarity in roles and responsibilities."}
