{"reference_id": "", "content": "Q: How does your organization handle exceptions to standard access control policies, and what approval process is followed?\nA: Kestrel Cloud follows a strict compliance program for handling access control exceptions. Any deviation from standard policies requires documented approval from a designated Compliance Officer. This process is in line with our ISO 27001 framework. Requests are logged and tracked for audit purposes, ensuring accountability and traceability. We emphasize the importance of adhering to these controls to maintain the security posture of Kestrel Cloud."}
