e Orrery Business Suite framework. Customers are advised to engage with Orrery Software's support team to tailor logging settings. They play a critical role in managing their access configurations, guided by Orrery Business Suite, and Orrery Business Suite engages with them to confirm their data handling aligns with the suite's standards. Orrery Software ensures customers are aware of their responsibilities in maintaining compliance with background checks for their employees. Customers are provided with detailed reports on power consumption. They are users of Orrery Business Suite who are expected to follow specific guidelines regarding data management and are encouraged to familiarize themselves with their responsibilities in the shared security framework provided by Orrery Software. They are also encouraged to participate in Orrery Software's backup and restore tests, configure their backup preferences, and maintain vigilance in their operational environments to complement security measures. Customers are individuals or organizations informed of their responsibilities in the shared security model with Orrery Business Suite and its subprocessors, and they place trust in the company, whose data integrity and security are protected.<SEP>Entities that may be impacted by vulnerabilities and whose data Orrery Software is committed to protecting.<SEP>External parties who are informed of their responsibilities by Orrery Software, particularly in managing user access and data security.<SEP>Individuals or organizations that are informed of their responsibilities regarding data security by Orrery Software.<SEP>Customers are encouraged to follow guidelines to secure their configurations and data, complementing Orrery Software's efforts to protect the Orrery Business Suite.<SEP>Entities encouraged to participate in the security process to understand their role in maintaining security.<SEP>Entities that are responsible for managing their user access and data security."}
